        {
          "id": 2216466899,
          "type": null,
          "body": "`cap_session->count` has the total number of packets in an offline \"don't display the packets in real time\" session, and gets reset to the number of packets in the last file when capture stops. So it can also be a uint64_t for the same reason.",
